concept_contexts.Network Images:
Use Image.network for online images
Use FadeInImage.assetNetwork for placeholder + fade-in
Consider caching for performance and offline reuse

// Simple network image:
Image.network(
  'https://example.com/dice3.png',
  width: 160, height: 160, fit: BoxFit.contain,
);

// Placeholder + fade-in:
FadeInImage.assetNetwork(
  placeholder: 'assets/dice1.png',
  image: 'https://example.com/dice3.png',
  width: 160, height: 160, fit: BoxFit.contain,
)

